(SANTORINI - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(An abstract building game for 2 to 4 players on a 5 x 5 board. Each player has 2) Tj T*
(workers. Move a worker up onto the third level of a building to win.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Starting with the youngest player, each player places their 2 workers on any free) Tj T*
(spaces.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(YOUR TURN) Tj T*
(Choose one of your workers. It must move and then build.) Tj T*
(1. Move to one of the 8 neighbouring spaces. A worker may move up at most one level,) Tj T*
(   and may move) Tj T*
(   down any number of levels. It may not move onto a space with a worker or a dome.) Tj T*
(2. Build next to the worker that moved: a block on a free space, or a dome on top of a) Tj T*
(   level 3) Tj T*
(   building. A space with a dome is complete and can not be entered.) Tj T*
ET
