(WINNING) Tj T*
(You win immediately when one of your workers moves up onto the third level. Being) Tj T*
(forced to stay on level 3 or building it does not count; only moving up onto it wins.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(LOSING) Tj T*
(If you can not move any worker and then build, you lose.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GOD POWERS) Tj T*
(In the full game each player has a God Power card that changes one rule, for example) Tj T*
(Apollo may swap places with an opponent's worker and Atlas may build a dome at any) Tj T*
(level. Beginners play without them.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 AND 4 PLAYERS) Tj T*
(With 3 players, everybody plays alone. With 4 players, play in two teams of two:) Tj T*
(teammates share their 4 workers and take turns alternately.) Tj T*
ET
